          "The resulting wrench is mapped to eight thrusts with a 6×8 allocation matrix built from the thruster positions and directions in a YAML file (column i is [Fᵢ ; rᵢ × Fᵢ]). It is solved with the Moore–Penrose pseudo-inverse, clamped per thruster, and converted to PWM with piecewise-linear T200 maps at 16 V.",
